{"h":3406,"lines":[{"w":0.33850565592447912,"y":0.037555786349534492,"h":0.019628290701668494,"c":1,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","x":0.067868611375808338},{"y":0.087157186795212338,"h":0.023794945869736961,"w":0.38170483907063801,"x":0.067943193872790367,"c":1,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 1"},{"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","y":0.12645348841699022,"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.068041240155430671,"c":1,"w":0.21443298339843753},{"w":0.83917526245117191,"x":0.065979378973257591,"c":1,"h":0.017615971814445186,"y":0.16412213729780689,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6 score. Here is the"},{"h":0.014534883616744931,"w":0.22061854044596355,"y":0.18313953479046474,"x":0.063917533550214095,"t":"examiner's comment:","c":1},{"y":0.21902314330393391,"x":0.11541545132452152,"w":0.80837524414062489,"h":0.019022080874485092,"t":"The candidate has reported all the data in the graph and provides summaries of","c":1},{"t":"the main trends (The production of carbon dioxide in Portugal and Italy was steadily","h":0.017441861012089666,"c":1,"x":0.11340205757607606,"y":0.2383720927471813,"w":0.84742268880208349},{"x":0.11340206494962937,"w":0.8144329833984375,"c":1,"y":0.25719318826591553,"h":0.017615971814445075,"t":"increasing during that period, The emission of carbon dioxide in United Kingdom"},{"h":0.017441861012089888,"w":0.81237111409505203,"t":"and Sweden was under decrease during that period of time). There are attempts","y":0.27470930204899102,"c":1,"x":0.11546392736161655},{"t":"at comparison (The emission of carbon dioxide in United Kingdom in 1967 was","x":0.11546392426652669,"h":0.017446981621572544,"c":1,"w":0.79793813069661468,"y":0.29359953027578367},{"c":1,"t":"the highest one among all these 4 countries, In 2007 the emission in Sweden was","x":0.11546390520125044,"y":0.31238989989665855,"w":0.82680414835611971,"h":0.017615971814445075},{"t":"at the same level with Portugal), but there is some irrelevant material in the final","x":0.11752577808829301,"y":0.33139534856094521,"c":1,"h":0.017441861012089777,"w":0.80618555704752604},{"y":0.34879624191010195,"h":0.017615971814445186,"c":1,"w":0.83711339314778643,"t":"paragraph. There is a clear overall progression, with some use of cohesive devices","x":0.11546392190361075},{"w":0.83917526245117191,"h":0.019083969465648942,"c":1,"y":0.36758661164783035,"t":"(However, in the beginning). The range of lexis is adequate and appropriate for the","x":0.11340205932576111},{"w":0.84742268880208327,"y":0.38662790748984488,"h":0.020348836167447981,"t":"task (production of carbon dioxide, a bit higher, increased, decreased) and although","x":0.11340205757596067,"c":1},{"t":"there are some errors in word choice (was under decrease, underwent\/continued)","x":0.11329003768813815,"y":0.40358825224631301,"w":0.82909790039062503,"h":0.021810478976524772,"c":1},{"w":0.80618555704752604,"c":1,"x":0.11340206673252907,"y":0.42441860449224555,"t":"and spelling (tones\/tonnes, deacrease), these do not prevent the message from","h":0.018916686142604},{"c":1,"y":0.44331395321222655,"t":"coming across. There are some attempts to produce complex sentence forms, with","x":0.11546392190297373,"w":0.83711339314778643,"h":0.017441861012089666},{"t":"good control over grammatical accuracy.","x":0.11546391749160202,"w":0.4103092702229818,"h":0.017615971814445186,"y":0.46065766284692455,"c":1},{"t":"The graph shows the changes in the emission of carbon dioxide. in 4 European countrie.s","y":0.497337463295348,"w":0.87847269694010433,"c":1,"x":0.067978999165159829,"h":0.018030574303547042},{"y":0.51691510797698548,"w":0.32409332275390623,"c":1,"t":"in the periad from 1967 to 2007.","h":0.018848311670093931,"x":0.063699083430720366},{"x":0.06582376239468847,"t":"The production of carbon dioxide in Portugal and Italy was steadily increasing during that","h":0.024124297826904728,"w":0.89511322021484374,"c":1,"y":0.54059872207829285},{"w":0.89499989827473969,"y":0.56059922120189365,"h":0.020126698931314912,"t":"period. In 1967 emission of carbon dioxide in Portugal was approximatelly 1.3 metric tonne.s","c":1,"x":0.063844892586926397},{"c":1,"h":0.019083969465648831,"t":"and in 2007 the emission there achieved 5.4. In Italy in the beginning of the period was","x":0.063917517388031989,"y":0.58132706940090695,"w":0.89484537760416671},{"t":"a bit higher than 4. However, it increased only fill 7.8 by 2007.","x":0.063812577775371762,"c":1,"w":0.62906646728515636,"y":0.59948913030551187,"h":0.020333619938131986},{"h":0.015988371754420583,"t":"The emission of carbon dioxide in United Kingdom and Sweden was under decrease during","y":0.62645348853735683,"c":1,"x":0.07010307428001529,"w":0.88247426350911462},{"x":0.061799573429985342,"c":1,"y":0.6438055110249038,"w":0.86609659830729169,"h":0.019494599338426233,"t":"that period of time. 'The emission of carbon dioxide in United Kingdon in 1967 was the."},{"y":0.66054419107079398,"h":0.023070251948680842,"c":1,"x":0.061741925241527912,"w":0.88269287109375005,"t":"highest one among all these. 4 countrie,s labout I). But after 1967, it gradually decreased"},{"t":"to about 9 metric tones. The emission in Sweden was around 8, 6 metric tones in","x":0.063847857959809559,"y":0.68007122611552151,"w":0.82488835652669279,"c":1,"h":0.018318259149037286},{"h":0.020348656968515955,"c":1,"x":0.061800552232106058,"y":0.69996015571711134,"w":0.85168207804361995,"t":"the beginning, then it steadily increased till 10.5 metric tone.s. However, in 1977 it gort"},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"w":0.85154637654622389,"x":0.063917533362467041,"y":0.71947674411788842,"c":1,"t":"tremendous deacrease in the. emission of carbon dioxide which underwent fill 2007. In"},{"w":0.8249356079101563,"c":1,"y":0.7341840595196375,"x":0.063836171966397903,"t":"2007 thie emission in Sweden was at the. same level with Porrugal - around 5.4-5.6.","h":0.019631182524434188},{"h":0.018159554974863434,"y":0.76395171455023247,"c":1,"w":0.81660339355468736,"t":"The change.s in emission of carbon dioxide can be connected with the. changes in","x":0.065916568746969703},{"h":0.017867186877283725,"y":0.782088163045915,"t":"economical development and appearance of some new technologies which re.duce.","x":0.063855837297278228,"c":1,"w":0.79187184651692699},{"h":0.012179244215601792,"c":1,"y":0.80306421219444757,"t":"emissions.","w":0.099452266693115243,"x":0.063690420869072562},{"c":1,"y":0.94912790687529103,"x":0.05773195948482903,"w":0.039175256093343096,"t":"136","h":0.013081395479068947},{"w":0.29360280354817708,"h":0.0241457972187753,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.35215498527080541,"y":0.95282647550815269,"c":1}],"w":2400}